 * Budget against actual loss, per cost centre and loss category, for a run of months — FORMULAS.md "budget variance". The only place it is worked out.
 *
 *   budget    Σ **approved** budgets of the cost centre (and category) for the months in the period
 *   actual    Σ validated actual figures (current, not superseded) of incidents tagged with the cost centre that occurred in the period, are not
 *             duplicates and not rejected — of that category; for a budget with no category, of every category of the cost centre
 *   variance  actual − budget (positive = over budget)
 *   variance %  variance ÷ budget × 100, 2 decimals half up away from zero; null when the budget is 0
 *
 * A category with actual loss but no budget shows with a budget of 0 (so it is never hidden). The cost centre is flat: a parent does not add up its
 * children. Everything is limited to the company and the branches the person works in (incidents) through the tenant scopes.
 */";s:65:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode␀namespaceUses";O:30:"PHPStan\Analyser\NamespaceUses":3:{s:9:"namespace";s:28:"App\Modules\Finance\Services";s:4:"uses";a:4:{s:6:"budget";s:33:"App\Modules\Finance\Models\Budget";s:12:"lossincident";s:36:"App\Modules\Loss\Models\LossIncident";s:15:"carboninterface";s:22:"Carbon\CarbonInterface";s:2:"db";s:29:"Illuminate\Support\Facades\DB";}s:9:"constUses";a:0:{}}}s:59:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀abstract";b:0;s:56:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀final";b:1;s:58:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀extends";N;s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀implements";a:0:{}s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀usedTraits";a:0:{}s:70:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀traitUseAdaptations";a:0:{}s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀statements";a:1:{i:0;O:50:"PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedMethodNode":11:{s:56:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedMethodNode␀name";s:9:"forPeriod";s:58:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedMethodNode␀phpDoc";O:50:"PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode":2:{s:64:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode␀phpDocString";s:214:"/**
