 * The one door for recruitment: openings, candidates, applications and their stages, interviews, offers and hiring.
 *
 *   - An opening is draft → open → closed (it can be re-opened); people apply only to an open one, once each; an application is by one candidate to one opening.
 *   - An application moves applied → screening → interview; rejecting or withdrawing needs a reason and cancels what is still planned for it. **Offer and hired are reached only by
 *     `makeOffer` and `hire`**, never by moving the stage. Every move is written to the append-only application history.
 *   - An interview is booked for a future time with an active login of the company as interviewer; **only that interviewer writes its feedback**, and not before the day.
 *   - An offer needs an interview a person recommended hiring on; it carries no money (salary is payroll). Accepting it makes the application ready to hire; declining withdraws the application.
 *   - `hire` makes the employee file through `EmployeeService::create`, once (the application row is locked, and `hired_employee_id` is unique), and never more people than the opening has
 *     positions (the opening row is locked): when the last position is filled the opening closes itself. A new hire starts on probation for six months.
 *   - Everything here needs `recruitment.create` / `recruitment.edit`, except the interviewer's feedback.
 */";s:65:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode␀namespaceUses";O:30:"PHPStan\Analyser\NamespaceUses":3:{s:9:"namespace";s:23:"App\Modules\HR\Services";s:4:"uses";a:17:{s:4:"user";s:15:"App\Models\User";s:16:"applicationevent";s:38:"App\Modules\HR\Models\ApplicationEvent";s:9:"candidate";s:31:"App\Modules\HR\Models\Candidate";s:8:"employee";s:30:"App\Modules\HR\Models\Employee";s:9:"interview";s:31:"App\Modules\HR\Models\Interview";s:14:"jobapplication";s:36:"App\Modules\HR\Models\JobApplication";s:10:"jobopening";s:32:"App\Modules\HR\Models\JobOpening";s:5:"offer";s:27:"App\Modules\HR\Models\Offer";s:10:"department";s:37:"App\Modules\Masters\Models\Department";s:11:"designation";s:38:"App\Modules\Masters\Models\Designation";s:8:"location";s:34:"App\Modules\Shared\Models\Location";s:7:"tenancy";s:40:"App\Modules\Shared\Models\Scopes\Tenancy";s:13:"tenantcontext";s:40:"App\Modules\Shared\Tenancy\TenantContext";s:15:"carbonimmutable";s:22:"Carbon\CarbonImmutable";s:22:"authorizationexception";s:45:"Illuminate\Auth\Access\AuthorizationException";s:2:"db";s:29:"Illuminate\Support\Facades\DB";s:19:"validationexception";s:41:"Illuminate\Validation\ValidationException";}s:9:"constUses";a:0:{}}}s:59:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀abstract";b:0;s:56:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀final";b:1;s:58:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀extends";N;s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀implements";a:0:{}s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀usedTraits";a:0:{}s:70:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀traitUseAdaptations";a:0:{}s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀statements";a:17:{i:0;O:58:"PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassConstantsNode":5:{s:69:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassConstantsNode␀constants";a:1:{i:0;O:57:"PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassConstantNode":3:{s:63:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNod