 * Inspections — the one door for their data and for what they do to a batch.
 *
 *  - **Starting** takes an approved, active plan, a branch the person works in and (for an item tracked by batch) the batch. The plan's checks are copied as the results to fill in. The batch is
 *    put **on hold** (quarantine) for the time being: nobody can issue or move it. A batch already on hold because of an earlier failed inspection is taken over, so a re-inspection can release
 *    it; one on hold for any other reason is refused. Only one inspection of a batch is open at a time.
 *  - **Recording** writes measurements and pass / fail checks; whether each *passed* is worked out here from the limits, never typed. Allowed while the inspection is open.
 *  - **Completing** needs every check recorded. Everything within limits → *accepted* and the hold is released; any check outside → *failed*, and the batch stays on hold.
 *  - **Deciding a failed inspection:** *reject* (raises a non-conformance report; the batch stays on hold) or *accept with a deviation* (a reason of at least 10 characters, by someone other
 *    than the inspector; the batch is released). **Cancelling** an open inspection releases its hold.
 *  - Every change takes the inspection's row lock first.
 */";s:65:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode␀namespaceUses";O:30:"PHPStan\Analyser\NamespaceUses":3:{s:9:"namespace";s:28:"App\Modules\Quality\Services";s:4:"uses";a:13:{s:4:"user";s:15:"App\Models\User";s:18:"fieldruleexception";s:45:"App\Modules\CRM\Exceptions\FieldRuleException";s:5:"batch";s:34:"App\Modules\Inventory\Models\Batch";s:10:"itemlookup";s:39:"App\Modules\Masters\Services\ItemLookup";s:10:"inspection";s:37:"App\Modules\Quality\Models\Inspection";s:14:"inspectionplan";s:41:"App\Modules\Quality\Models\InspectionPlan";s:16:"inspectionresult";s:43:"App\Modules\Quality\Models\InspectionResult";s:12:"documenttype";s:37:"App\Modules\Shared\Enums\DocumentType";s:8:"location";s:34:"App\Modules\Shared\Models\Location";s:19:"numberseriesservice";s:47:"App\Modules\Shared\Services\NumberSeriesService";s:13:"tenantcontext";s:40:"App\Modules\Shared\Tenancy\TenantContext";s:2:"db";s:29:"Illuminate\Support\Facades\DB";s:19:"validationexception";s:41:"Illuminate\Validation\ValidationException";}s:9:"constUses";a:0:{}}}s:59:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀abstract";b:0;s:56:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀final";b:1;s:58:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀extends";N;s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀implements";a:0:{}s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀usedTraits";a:0:{}s:70:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀traitUseAdaptations";a:0:{}s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀statements";a:6:{i:0;O:50:"PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedMethodNode":11:{s:56:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedMethodNode␀name";s:11:"__construct";s:58:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedMethodNode␀phpDoc";N;s:57:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedMethodNode␀byRef";b:0;s:58:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedMethodNode␀public";b:1;s:59:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedMethodNode␀private";b:0;s:60:"␀PH